 "text": "Hi, how's everything with you? A big cooler with ice that doesn't melt fast is the main one. You can also use a few full glasses instead of big jug. A bottle keeps the room warmer for far longer than a glass, so it' best to keep it in the cooler. Very much so. A bottled drink cools down much faster than one in a glass, because the bottle tends to heat up faster. Small drinks in big boxes work well. They stay cold for hours, and the kids can't see through them.",
